NGREDIENT BRAIN.** 🩸 **`chicken` returns KOREAN STEAMED EGGS and COBB SALAD —<br/>   they match on chicken *STOCK*.** 🩸 **`fish` is BLIND to hake · snoek · salmon · tuna · prawns.**<br/>   💰 **AND IT COSTS MONEY: a thin result (<10) WAKES THE PAID CHEF. A BLIND LEXICON IS AN API BILL.**<br/>   **A ·** the **`not:`** list *(stock · broth · cube ≠ the protein)* — **~20 words.**<br/>   **B ·** the **`is:`** list *(fish = hake·snoek·salmon·tuna·prawns)* — **Tina's food knowledge.** ⚖️ **Law 11.**<br/><br/>**7. 🔧** **MF76** *(inputs under 16px — a tablet ZOOMS ITSELF IN)* · **MF71** *(the black chrome — a HEX,<br/>   not a token)* · **MF70** *(wk_europe double-encoded — a DECODE, not a retype)* · **MF52** *(a wrong<br/>   image path)* · **MF84** *(`shepherds pie` → 0 hits. NOBODY TYPES THE APOSTROPHE ON A PHONE)* ·<br/>   **MF29 + MF33** 💣 *(`Math.ceil` over-bills ~2.5× in Bakes — **BAKED GOODS LOOK DEARER THAN<br/>   SHOP-BOUGHT. THAT INVERTS THE WHOLE PITCH.**)* · **MF91 + MF92** *(parked)*"]
